{
  "name": "Weekly PubMed & Europe PMC KOL Literature Watch (Apify -> Google Sheets + Slack)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-pubmed-weekly",
      "name": "Weekly Monday 08:00 Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/yannabadie~pubmed-europepmc-api-mcp/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{$env.APIFY_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"mode\": \"search\",\n  \"query\": \"GLP-1 semaglutide\",\n  \"pubYearFrom\": 2025,\n  \"onlyWithEmail\": true,\n  \"hasFreePdf\": true,\n  \"sortBy\": \"date\",\n  \"maxResults\": 50\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-pubmed-call",
      "name": "Fetch PubMed & Europe PMC Papers (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "valid-pmid",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.pmid}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-valid-pmids",
      "name": "Keep Valid PubMed Papers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PubMed_KOL_Papers",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "PMID": "={{$json.pmid}}",
            "Year": "={{$json.pubYear}}",
            "Citations": "={{$json.citedByCount}}",
            "Title": "={{$json.title}}",
            "Journal": "={{$json.journalIso}}",
            "FirstAuthor": "={{$json.firstAuthor}}",
            "AuthorEmail": "={{$json.primaryAuthorEmail}}",
            "LinkedNCTs": "={{($json.linkedClinicalTrialNcts || []).join(', ')}}",
            "FreePDF": "={{$json.freePdfUrl}}",
            "PubMedURL": "={{$json.pubmedUrl}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "PMID"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-pubmed-save",
      "name": "Upsert Papers & Author Emails to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1020,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL}}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": \"New PubMed paper: *{{$json.title}}* ({{$json.journalIso}} {{$json.pubYear}})\\nAuthor: {{$json.primaryAuthorEmail || 'N/A'}} | Citations: {{$json.citedByCount || 0}}\\nPDF/Link: {{$json.freePdfUrl || $json.pubmedUrl}}\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "slack-pubmed-alert",
      "name": "Post KOL Paper Alert to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly PubMed & Europe PMC KOL Watch\n1. Set n8n env vars `APIFY_TOKEN` and `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n2. Customize `query`, `pubYearFrom`, `onlyWithEmail`, and `hasFreePdf` in **Fetch PubMed & Europe PMC Papers**.\n3. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and run a manual test before activating the weekly schedule.",
        "height": 195,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Idempotent Literature Pipeline\n- **Keep Valid PubMed Papers** drops items missing a `pmid`.\n- **Upsert Papers & Author Emails to Google Sheets** deduplicates on `PMID` and stores linked NCT trials + open-access PDF URLs.\n- Slack receives formatted title, journal, author email, citation count, and direct PDF/PubMed link.",
        "height": 175,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-output",
      "name": "Deduplication & KOL Alert Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Weekly Monday 08:00 Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch PubMed & Europe PMC Papers (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch PubMed & Europe PMC Papers (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep Valid PubMed Papers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep Valid PubMed Papers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert Papers & Author Emails to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Post KOL Paper Alert to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "instanceId": "yannabadie-pubmed-kol-template-v1"
  }
}
